{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary <i>Men of War</i> RTS series has finally reached the cold war era. Take command of either U.S. or Soviet forces, fulfill mission objectives and claim victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/4d9db85ea37cedea42dece81c6e84c32.poster.avif?t=1773656381\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/4d9db85ea37cedea42dece81c6e84c32.webm?t=1773656381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/4d9db85ea37cedea42dece81c6e84c32.mp4?t=1773656381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control vast armies of regular and specialized units, including support vehicles, light and heavy tanks, artillery vehicles, combat helicopters and game-changing jet fighters. Take to the battlefields of destroyed cities, fortified border zones, rural farmlands, destroyed airbases and sleepy winter villages in the latest installment of this classic RTS series, in which strong leadership and good management are the keys to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/2e00664562e2a16a664ca11b87da0fe8.poster.avif?t=1773656381\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/2e00664562e2a16a664ca11b87da0fe8.webm?t=1773656381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/2e00664562e2a16a664ca11b87da0fe8.mp4?t=1773656381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time in the series, dynamic campaign generation makes its debut. <i>Men of War: Assault Squad 2 \u2013 Cold War</i> gives players nearly endless experiences in both singleplayer and cooperative campaign modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/8b00bf2703f8ce5cb5a5e072957e624a.poster.avif?t=1773656381\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/8b00bf2703f8ce5cb5a5e072957e624a.webm?t=1773656381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/8b00bf2703f8ce5cb5a5e072957e624a.mp4?t=1773656381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your side: The United States of America versus the Soviet Union.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic campaign generator makes singleplayer and co-op extremely replayable, with randomized skirmishes and custom army compositions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive online multiplayer modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault Zones mode: Capture and hold flag points using all military means possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilation mode: Dominate the enemy or capture their base; valuable resources can also be secured on the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command large armies or control single units with the series-defining Direct Control Mode.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1135240?t=1773656381","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/855c4fac02ac7a7c26a8392e504dc0e6af34ece0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773656381","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/3b983f7d06a587d09108e059ba0923cae5ae89ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773656381","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/3b983f7d06a587d09108e059ba0923cae5ae89ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773656381","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Men of War II Available Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary <i>Men of War</i> RTS series has finally reached the cold war era. Take command of either U.S. or Soviet forces, fulfill mission objectives and claim victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/4d9db85ea37cedea42dece81c6e84c32.poster.avif?t=1773656381\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/4d9db85ea37cedea42dece81c6e84c32.webm?t=1773656381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135240/extras/4d9db85ea37cedea42dece81c6e84c32.mp4?t=1773656381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control vast armies of regular and specialized units, including support vehicles, 